    "overview": "TheAnt Esports Chassis Crystal Neois a premium gaming cabinet designed to deliver excellent airflow, reliable performance, and compatibility with modern high-performance PC builds. Featuring support for E-ATX, ATX, M-ATX, and M-ITX motherboards, 6 pre-installed ARGB fans, and support for graphics cards up to 415mm long, it ensures flexibility, durability, and efficient cooling. With support for CPU air coolers up to 179mm and 360mm AIO liquid cooling on the top, it is ideal for gaming, content creation, and demanding workloads. The cabinet also includes tempered glass, cable management support, USB Type-C connectivity, and support for up to 1 HDD and 2 SSDs. Whether you are building a new gaming PC or upgrading your existing setup, it offers excellent functionality, stylish design, and dependable performance for PC enthusiasts.",
